WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.628
"My new shell!" Herbie cried.

2
00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:11.504
"I need a shell to protect me!"

3
00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:14.549
"We'll find it," Cora said.

4
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:20.547
"We're great at finding things," Mo said.

5
00:00:20.548 --> 00:00:29.724
"Wait here," Cora said. "We'll be back soon."

6
00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:35.948
Cora and Mo went to the compass.

7
00:00:35.949 --> 00:00:39.300
The shell opened.

8
00:00:39.301 --> 00:00:48.797
"Look!" Mo said. "A picture of Herbie's shell!"

9
00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:51.817
"There goes the arrow!" Cora said.

10
00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:54.187
"Let's go, Mo.

11
00:00:54.188 --> 00:01:00.751
Soon Herbie will have his shell back!"

12
00:01:00.752 --> 00:01:05.684
Cora and Mo swam past coral.

13
00:01:05.685 --> 00:01:09.143
They swam past rocks.

14
00:01:09.144 --> 00:01:15.721
"The shell went far," Mo said.

15
00:01:15.722 --> 00:01:24.638
Finally the arrow stopped and pointed.

16
00:01:24.639 --> 00:01:27.841
"The shell!" Mo said.

17
00:01:27.842 --> 00:01:33.013
Cora picked it up. "Oh no! A crack!"

18
00:01:33.014 --> 00:01:36.075
"Can Herbie still use it?" Mo said.

19
00:01:36.076 --> 00:01:41.038
"I don't think so." Cora sighed.

20
00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:47.531
"Let's go ask him."

21
00:01:47.532 --> 00:01:49.474
Herbie shook his head.

22
00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:54.546
"I can't use a shell with a crack.

23
00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:57.910
Can you help me find another one?"

24
00:01:57.911 --> 00:02:01.397
"Sure," Cora said. "We'll—"

25
00:02:01.398 --> 00:02:05.159
"Herbie, hide!" a crab cried.

26
00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:10.986
"A dangerous stingray is coming!"

27
00:02:10.987 --> 00:02:18.680
Herbie looked scared. "I have no shell.

28
00:02:18.681 --> 00:02:21.975
That stingray will eat me!"

29
00:02:21.976 --> 00:02:25.014
"Come on, Mo!" Cora said.

30
00:02:25.015 --> 00:02:29.899
"We have to find a new shell—fast!"

